r10v86 — WHAT EVERY DIFFERING FILE IN THE WIDE BOUNDARY IS.

The walk covers a COPY of tools/probe taken at the state the IMPLEMENTER's
patch produced — LISTED = 3857, the same file set the implementer walked, so
the tallies are directly comparable.  (This verifier's OWN ten arms are not in
that copy; they are measured by the three-database scorer instead, which is
stronger: it scores against GOLDEN, not merely pristine-vs-patched.)

